{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":360,"bright":1,"y":-180,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":360,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嗯？我之前去哪里了？[r][l]还不是因为艾尔莎她们早上又偷偷把麦粉和面包放到营地门口，害的我又得忙活好久。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]忙什么？当然是因为不能白拿她们的东西，所以得去周边打点猎换点钱好还给她啊。[r][l]真是的，那个毛耳朵，每次都把我当小孩子看……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嗯？你说这是她关心我的方式，不然说声谢谢收下？我、我才不想和她说谢谢呢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]不是那个意思。我不喜欢欠别人的人情。[r][l]你也这么觉得吧？好，那就用我们的方式回敬给她！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"yd_002_05-备份","des":"米托拉-关于人情"}